    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Years of hiding have made Neko Majins a master of hiding their true self.</p>\n<p>At <strong>Level</strong> 1 you know the <em>Disguise Self</em> and <em>Alter Self</em> <strong>Spells</strong> as if through the <em>Mysticism</em> <strong>Class Feature</strong> except their duration becomes 8 hours.</p>\n<p>At <strong>Level</strong> 10 you also gain the <em>Polymorph</em> <strong>Spell</strong> as if through the <em>Mysticism</em> <strong>Class Feature</strong>.\nThese <strong>Spells</strong> can only target yourself.</p>\n",
